楊何，傳授不當父子；引古人物保留傳說性。冉季字子產不接鄭子產，原憲子思不接孔子後世子思；名錄各條同字子徒、子聲、子上、皙等均保留不同候選，鄭國是此條人名。魯昭公夫人孟子不接戰國孟子。全152段明示姓名首輪已存，未名者、代詞、版本及跨篇身份待覆核。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p065","text":"宓不齊字子賤。少孔子三十歳。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m065-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"宓不齊","kind":"person","person_id":"x3c_d03_60b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m065-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"子賤","kind":"person","person_id":"x3c_d03_60b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m065-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"0xl_7ir_tmn","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples","book_id":"b-shiji-067","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-067-disciples"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p066","text":"孔子謂子賤，「君子哉！魯無君子，斯焉取斯？」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m066-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"0xl_7ir_tmn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m066-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"子賤","kind":"person","person_id":"x3c_d03_60b","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples","book_id":"b-shiji-067","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-067-disciples"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p067","text":"子賤爲單父宰，反命於孔子，曰：「此國有賢不齊者五人，教不齊所以治者。」孔子曰：「惜哉不齊所治者小，所治者大則庶幾矣。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m067-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"子賤","kind":"person","person_id":"x3c_d03_60b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m067-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"0xl_7ir_tmn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m067-00